<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Sunrise Central Hotel - Cần Thơ (5 Sao)</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            color: #333;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        }

        /* NAVBAR */
        .navbar-custom {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); 
            padding: 15px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3); 
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            color: #d4af37 !important;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .brand-stars i {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            margin-right: 2px;
            color: #d4af37;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: #e0e0e0 !important;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-left: 25px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

            .nav-link:hover {
                color: #d4af37 !important;
            }

        .btn-book-now {
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #d4af37, #f9d976);
            color: #000;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 0;
            padding: 10px 25px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

            .btn-book-now:hover {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 8px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
                color: #000; 
            }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background-color: #111; 
            color: #aaa;
            padding: 70px 0 30px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

            footer h5 {
                color: #d4af37;
                margin-bottom: 25px;
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
            }

            footer ul {
                list-style: none;
                padding: 0;
            }

            footer li {
                margin-bottom: 12px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

                footer li i {
                    margin-right: 10px;
                    color: #d4af37;
                    margin-top: 4px;
                }

            footer a {
                color: #aaa;
                text-decoration: none;
                transition: color 0.3s;
            }

                footer a:hover {
                    color: #d4af37;
                }

        .payment-icons i {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-right: 15px;
            color: #ccc;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

            .payment-icons i:hover {
                color: #d4af37;
            }

        .staff-login-link {
            opacity: 0.5;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

            .staff-login-link:hover {
                opacity: 1;
                color: #fff !important;
                text-decoration: underline !important;
            }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-dark navbar-custom fixed-top">
            <div class="container">
                <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-start">
                        <span><i class="fas fa-hotel me-2"></i> SUNRISE CENTRAL</span>
                        <div class="brand-stars mt-1">
                            <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarContent">
                    <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
                </button>
                <div class="collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-end" id="navbarContent">
                    <ul class="navbar-nav align-items-center">
                        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Trang chủ</a></li>
                        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#room-list">Phòng nghỉ</a></li>
                        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="#services">Dịch vụ</a></li>
                        <li class="nav-item ms-3">
                            <a class="btn btn-book-now" href="/#booking-area">ĐẶT PHÒNG NGAY</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div style="padding-top: 0;">
        @RenderBody()
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-5">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                    <h5>SUNRISE CENTRAL HOTEL</h5>
                    <p>Biểu tượng nghỉ dưỡng đẳng cấp <strong>5 sao</strong> tại trung tâm Cần Thơ. Nơi trải nghiệm dịch vụ hoàn hảo và không gian sang trọng bậc nhất.</p>
                    <div class="mt-3 text-warning">
                        <i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                    <h5>LIÊN HỆ</h5>
                    <ul>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i> Số 01 Đại Lộ Hòa Bình, Q. Ninh Kiều, TP. Cần Thơ</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-phone-alt"></i> (+84) 292 3838 999</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> info@sunrisecentral.vn</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                    <h5>CHẤP NHẬN THANH TOÁN</h5>
                    <div class="payment-icons mt-3">
                        <i class="fab fa-cc-visa" title="Visa"></i>
                        <i class="fab fa-cc-mastercard" title="Mastercard"></i>
                        <i class="fab fa-cc-amex" title="American Express"></i>
                        <i class="fab fa-cc-jcb" title="JCB"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="mt-4">KẾT NỐI</h5>
                    <div class="payment-icons">
                        <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
                        <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                        <a href="#"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr class="border-secondary mt-4" />
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center small text-muted">
                <div>
                    &copy; @DateTime.Now.Year Sunrise Central Hotel. All rights reserved.
                </div>

                <div>
                    <a href="/Dashboard" class="staff-login-link">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-lock me-1"></i> Staff Login
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="~/lib/jquery/dist/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/lib/bootstrap/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>